 s and meadows.\n\nJoin us Monday’s & Thursday’s from 7:00 am – 8:00 
 am at The Farm at Awbury for our Wellness Walks led by wellness coordinato
 r Megan Do Nascimento! Questions? Contact our Wellness Walk coordinate Meg
 an Do…\n\nSource: Awbury Arboretum\nEvent page: https://awbury.org/welln
 ess-walks/
