SUMMARY: Mini-Tuft Workshop at Tuft the World
DESCRIPTION:Test the waters of a new craft in three hours. In this hands-on
  class you'll learn to use a power tufting machine to make a 14x14" rug or
  wall hanging - setting up the frame and backing cloth\, threading the mac
 hine\, and tufting your own design or one of ours. All materials included\
 , and you take your finished piece home the same day. Beginner to intermed
 iate\, twelve seats\, no experience needed.\n\nbuy tickets here https://tu
 fttheworld.com/products/mini-tuft-workshop\n\nSource: Bok
LOCATION:Tuft the World/501\, 821 Dudley St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19148\, USA
CATEGORIES:Bok
END:VEVENT
