SUMMARY: One Day Tufting Workshop at Tuft the World
DESCRIPTION:Spend a full Saturday learning to tuft. Over five hours you'll 
 set up a frame and backing cloth\, thread and run a power tufting machine\
 , and build a 24x24" rug or wall hanging from your own design or one of ou
 rs - with time to finish properly rather than rush. All materials and equi
 pment provided\, and your piece goes home with you. Beginner to intermedia
 te\, twelve seats.\n\nbuy tickets here https://tufttheworld.com/products/o
 ne-day-tufting-workshop\n\nSource: Bok
LOCATION:Tuft the World/501\, 821 Dudley St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19148\, USA
CATEGORIES:Bok
END:VEVENT
