 , Risk and Failure | Sat\, Nov 14\, 2026 | 12:00 – 1:30 pm EST | Zoom\nC
 lick HERE to RSVP\n\nThe Museum for Art in Wood’s series of conversation
 s with queer woodworkers is back for another installment this fall. Guest 
