 nough and the aspects of creativity\, risk and failure can play in our liv
 es. Round table participants are Adam Atkinson\, Kate Hawes\, Katie Hudnal
 l\, Lisa…\n\nSource: Museum for Art in Wood\nEvent page: https://museumf
 orartinwood.org/event/queering-wood-craft-part-16-creativity-risk-and-fail
