SUMMARY:Makers Event
LOCATION:3502 Scotts Lane\, Philadelphia\, Pennsylvania\, 19129
DESCRIPTION:Led by master fiber artist Janell Wysock\, participants will le
 arn about the flax to linen process and explore 18th-century reproduction 
 tools. Try hands-on straw processing outdoors\, followed by an introductio
 n to spinning and weaving. Make time for your own project and take home wh
 at you create. Light snacks will be provided.\nChoose a ticket option that
  includes a handful of retted straw\, 1 lb of retted flax straw\, or 2 lbs
  of retted flax straw.\n\nSource: PA Flax Project\nEvent page: https://www
 .paflaxproject.com/events-1/nov-makers-event
URL:https://www.paflaxproject.com/events-1/nov-makers-event
CATEGORIES:PA Flax Project
END:VEVENT
