SUMMARY:Change is a Place
LOCATION:Vox Populi Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Animations break out of clean studio walls and charge wildly in
 to mud\, river\, dune\, and rainforest in this unforgettable collection of
  short films that embrace the uncertainty of the natural world. Frame by f
 rame\, these stop motion films carefully examine how place becomes time: s
 hadows turning\, water churning\, decay and growth\, the lifecycles of sto
 nes.\n\nSource: Vox Populi\nEvent page: https://www.voxpopuligallery.org/e
 vents/change-is-a-place
