DESCRIPTION:🎨✉️ PMSLAPS: RETURN TO SENDER\n\nA 228 Drawing Session f
 or Street Artists\, Slap Heads & Sticker Punks\n\nChill\, drink\, draw and
  collab with your sticker fam and friends.\n\nTUESDAY\, DECEMBER 15TH\n\n6
 -9PM\n\nNO COVER // FREE FUN\n\n21+ WITH VALID ID\n\nWe’re taking over t
 he upstairs at Tattooed Mom for a chill sticker drawing hangout — no rul
