SUMMARY: Rex: A Dinosaur's Story
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Lightbox Film Center https://www.lightboxfilmcenter.o
 rg/\n\nDirected by storied mogul and industry disruptor Haruki Kadokawa\, 
 and released two weeks before Jurassic Park\, Rex: A Dinosaur’s Story em
 erges from amber today as an exemplar of a bygone era of Japanese blockbus
 ters. It follows Chie (Yumi Adachi)\, the young daughter of a palaeontolog
 ist who soon befriends an adorable T-Rex. As everyone seeks to exploit the
  dino-discovery for profit\, the pair soon find themselves on the run…\n
 \nSource: Bok
LOCATION:Bok Auditorium\, 800 Mifflin Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19148\, US
 A
CATEGORIES:Bok
